  {lv:10, stage:"talk", q:"Can I use your pen? — ___", c:["OK, here you are.","It's Monday.","I'm hungry.","At six."], a:0, kw:"依頼", em:"🖊️", yaku:"「ペンを借りてもいい？」「いいよ、どうぞ。」", rel:[], exp:"Here you are. で手わたす。"},
  {lv:10, stage:"talk", q:"Would you like some tea? — ___", c:["Yes, please.","It's Sunday.","I'm fine.","At home."], a:0, kw:"すすめ", em:"🍵", yaku:"「お茶はいかが？」「はい、お願いします。」", rel:[], exp:"Would you like〜? には Yes, please.。"},
